mutatrix-transformation-laser-raptor-name = Laserraptor
mutatrix-transformation-laser-raptor-desc = Fast predator with ranged laser pressure. Good for pursuit and mobile combat.
mutatrix-transformation-ipc-name = IPC
mutatrix-transformation-ipc-desc = Resistant synthetic humanoid body with black plating and green Mutatrix glow.
mutatrix-transformation-feralis-name = Feralis
mutatrix-transformation-feralis-desc = Nearly blind lavaland predator guided by instinct and thermal perception. Strong in melee.
mutatrix-transformation-pyron-name = Pyron
mutatrix-transformation-pyron-desc = Living fire form. Always burning, immune to fire/heat, weak to water, with fireball and flame burst.
mutatrix-transformation-tetramus-name = Tetramus
mutatrix-transformation-tetramus-desc = Four-armed muscle form. Has four hands, goliath-level health, heavy punches, sprint and genetic jump.
mutatrix-transformation-cortex-name = Córtex
mutatrix-transformation-cortex-desc = Small and extremely intelligent form. Crawls into tight spaces, uses vents and has broad technical access.
mutatrix-transformation-goliath-name = Goliath
mutatrix-transformation-goliath-desc = Lavaland Goliath with huge health, crushing strikes and tentacle control.
mutatrix-transformation-ghoulstalker-name = Ghoul Stalker
mutatrix-transformation-ghoulstalker-desc = Fast flesh hunter with thermal vision, flash immunity and slashing piercing attacks.
mutatrix-transformation-legion-name = Legion
mutatrix-transformation-legion-desc = Corrupted lavaland form that shoots living skulls and fights like possessed bone mass.

mutatrix-chama-action-fireball-name = Fireball
mutatrix-chama-action-fireball-desc = Shoots a fireball similar to dragon breath.
mutatrix-chama-action-flame-name = Flame burst
mutatrix-chama-action-flame-desc = Spits a short burst of flame forward.

mutatrix-quatrobracos-action-jump-name = Genetic jump
mutatrix-quatrobracos-action-jump-desc = Uses Wega's genetic super jump.
mutatrix-quatrobracos-action-kick-name = Brutal charge
mutatrix-quatrobracos-action-kick-desc = Kicks or charges into a target, damaging and knocking it back.
